OL,3,GNEWSAWater supplies stable as burst
OL,4,Amain repair continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FProperties affected by a burst main in
OL,7,FSurrey have seen their supply remain
OL,8,Fstable overnight as repairs continue,
OL,9,Faccording to Thames Water.
OL,11,FAs many as 15,000 properties were left
OL,12,Fwithout water or with low pressure in
OL,13,FSurrey and London on Monday when the
OL,14,Fpipe burst in East Molesey, with some
OL,15,Fschools closing for the day.
OL,17,FThames Water later restored supply but
OL,18,Fsaid the main would "likely take some
OL,19,Ftime to fix".
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
